WEBVTT

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.370
New equipment?

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.760
Yes.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:04.260
In order for you to obtain it, we will need
to temporarily take your smartphones.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:14.130
<i>In order to fight the invaders, the Shinju-sama
bestowed powers upon the Heroes.</i>

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.600
<i>However, this was not granted to just anyone.</i>

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:27.600
<i>It was a very limited power restricted to those who resonate with the Shinju-sama at a high level.</i>

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:33.110
<i>Only these select few can wield that power.</i>

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:06.520
Ah!

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.150
Is this the new equipment?

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.350
Indeed.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:13.480
One which strengthens a Hero's
armaments by several times: a fairy.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.080
Nice to meet you!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.410
If we only had these back then...

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.060
No, it's nothing.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.870
It's reassuring to have these, isn't it?

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.080
Yeah!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.170
What a luxurious breakfast!
Did you make this, Sumi?

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:46.590
Yes! I made it with lots of vegetables
especially for today.

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:50.140
Why? It's perfectly okay to go all-out
with meat in the morning, you know.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:54.190
No! You should be more careful
with your health, Mother!

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.610
Now, let's eat up!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.370
Sumi?

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:08.570
You have your studies and your duty,
so don't push yourself too hard.

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:12.850
It's okay. This is about the only thing that I can do.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:18.880
Sumi, remember that you are
our precious daughter.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.760
I know. Thank you, Mother and Father.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:30.640
Besides, I love cooking.
Even more than Mother does.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.440
Well, then. I'll be heading out.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.900
Sure. Take care and be safe.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:49.470
For people like us, who couldn't have
children, she's just too good.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:51.500
She's a really good girl.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:57.690
Good morning!

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.860
Buenos díasancho!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:00.510
Huh?

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.640
We've been making it in secret
and hiding it from the teachers.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.100
About the other time... Uhm... I'm sorry.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.990
Things like this are supposed
to be prohibited, right?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.940
But we couldn't think of anything else...

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:29.990
We kept bugging you with questions without
thinking about you two or Gin-chan,

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:35.630
even though you have it so
much harder than we do.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:39.380
We really wanted to find a
way to apologize to you.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:47.600
We definitely have to keep this
a secret from the teachers.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.600
But...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.100
Thank you, really.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.780
Hey, your duty will end someday, right?

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.230
We can play normally after that, right?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.500
Eh? Yes.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.660
Hooray!

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:06.650
I want to become better friends
with you, Washio-san.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.620
Sancho is cute, isn't he?

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:17.650
Pumpkins! Pumpkins! It's a foreign festival!

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.500
It's thanks to our country's
great open-mindedness.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.230
We're able to enjoy all kinds of different festivals, right?

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:24.380
Yes.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:26.220
Wh-What is it?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.000
Put this hat on!

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.870
Look, Wasshi! It totally fits you!

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:32.310
Y-You think so?

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:36.390
You should learn that trick where
you pull pigeons from your hat!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.120
Hey! You can't just appear suddenly, Sebastian!

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.150
Seba...

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:45.280
Crow "Sebastian" Tengu.
I gave him a middle name!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.360
I-I see...

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:52.790
Ah! Geez, you can't just come
out whenever you want to!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.910
The fairies dispatched by the Shinju-sama...

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.000
are like this, huh?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:02.450
I'm sure that unlike their looks,
their powers are truly formidable!

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:04.390
I sure hope so...

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:07.500
Mama! There's a pumpkin
floating in the air!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.540
Eh? Ah, you're right.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.090
I-It's floating because of Alpha Waves!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.530
That's amazing!

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.480
Wasshi, you're amazing!

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:15.980
Hurry up and hide it!

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:22.170
If you say that it is part of their duty,
then there's nothing we can do.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.980
It is Sonoko's mission as she
was born into this family.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:28.310
But this shouldn't even
be her responsibility.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:32.560
Her soul will be able to always
be with the Shinju-sama.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.890
It is a very honorable thing indeed.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.750
I know, but...

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:41.750
If I could, I would gladly take her place myself.

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:47.840
Are we not allowed to tell the
girls about the new system?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:52.010
There's no way we can tell
them about this cruelty!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.470
I can understand how you feel.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:07:00.750
The Shouyumame flavor really
doesn't resonate with me...

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:03.930
Ehehe... Mino-san will get angry at you!

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.880
I'll have some of that vanilla flavor, Sonocchi!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.860
Waah! Wasshi stole some!

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:12.110
Those eyes look like they still want more!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:17.690
I ask that you steel your hearts.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:21.370
It is for the sake of the girls,
who are with the Shinju-sama, as well.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.010
It can't be...

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:27.050
It's just like we turned them into sacrifices!

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:33.030
<i>The title "Hero" sounds noble,</i>

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:39.580
<i>but those chosen have always
been offered as sacrifices.</i>

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:45.440
Father, Mother, and our friends at school...

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:50.510
It makes me really happy to know that they're all
cheering us on when we have to fulfill our duty.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.150
They even made a banner for us.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:01.230
Are they coming?

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.230
Yeah, they are.

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:05.810
We can already tell, huh...

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:13.460
<i>The coming battle will surely
be a difficult one.</i>

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:17.390
<i>That's what the Shinju-sama
was trying to tell us.</i>

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.270
It's time to brace ourselves.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.600
Yep! Focus, focus!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.320
Oh, right!

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:37.240
Take this, Wasshi.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:39.990
All right.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.200
You can tie your hair up
with it, if you want to.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.460
I'll try it on after the battle.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.310
Tell me if it suits me, Sonocchi.

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:49.130
Yeah!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.100
I will protect you, Sonocchi.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.590
And I'll protect you, Wasshi.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.690
It's a promise!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.980
Yes, a promise.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.220
Let's come back together, no matter what.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.800
Three of them?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.430
So that's how it is.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.270
All right, let's go!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.570
Roger that.

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:50.980
Oh, how cool!

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:27.980
Welcome. Your name is Shirogane.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.100
That's a nice one.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.200
Leave the backup to me.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.690
And I'll be the vanguard!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.830
With this...

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.790
I got all tingly...

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.680
Thanks, Sebastian!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.810
What is this?
I can't see anything!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.020
Gas?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.190
Could it be?

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:23.490
This is our new power as Heroes?

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.590
Here it comes!

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:26.870
Let's go!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.620
Mankai!
Mankai!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.250
Your attacks won't work anymore.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.210
What was that?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.590
Ooh.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.410
Wow! you want to smash me!

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.320
Just one left now.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.470
Wasshi?

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:53.830
My legs...

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.920
Huh?

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.370
My eye?

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.740
It came this far already?

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.520
Eh?

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.030
A lot of something came out!

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.830
There's too many of them!

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:35.160
Right now...

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.650
There's no choice!

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.670
Sonocchi!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.920
Got it!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.670
Mankai!
Mankai!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:17.620
Oh no!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.500
Wasshi!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.630
Sonocchi!

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.810
The Great Bridge...

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.330
My arm feels numb...

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.450
Oh n—

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.960
Sonocchi!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.600
You're okay.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:03.110
Listen, Wasshi. Something's not right.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.380
Can we really fight like this?

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.180
I don't know.

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:12.830
But right now, if we don't protect the
Shinju-sama, our world will end.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.100
Y-You're right.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.210
It's that attack again!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.560
I won't let you...

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.780
hurt anyone again!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.080
Wasshi!

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.640
Sonocchi, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:46.840
Stop it.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:52.090
Got it. Leave it to me, Wasshi!

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.430
Mankai!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.150
Out of my way!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.740
Get the hell...

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.080
out of here!!!

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.590
Eh? What's that?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.470
Wait!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:55.320
I thought my heart stopped
for a second there.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.700
I won't let you run away!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.450
What is... this?

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.980
Huh?

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.550
My heart...

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.240
isn't beating.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.950
Ah...

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:45.000
so that's how it is.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.400
The city...

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.150
Wasshi!

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:23.910
This is bad!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.090
This is really bad! Outside the wall—

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:27.750
Huh?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.460
Who... are you?

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:33.590
What's happening?

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:35.710
That's right, where's Gin?

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.880
Where did Gin go?

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.060
Wasshi!

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.410
It's all right.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.660
I'll do something about the rest.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.180
I'm Nogi Sonoko.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.470
You're Washio Sumi.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:13.380
And that girl, Minowa Gin.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:16.560
The three of us are friends.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.630
Forever, you know?

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:21.640
I won't die, you see.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.890
So we'll meet again soon.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:29.480
So, I'll be back quickly, okay?

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.690
Mankai!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.900
<i>It doesn't matter how many
times I approach death,</i>

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:51.210
<i>because I'll never die.</i>

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:57.090
<i>We're being kept alive.</i>

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:20.820
Where am I?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:30.000
Who am I?

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:53.160
As a result of the Great Bridge accident,
four people are missing, and several are injured.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:56.180
Search and rescue is currently underway.

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:58.150
Furthermore, the Taisha has given a statement

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:02.100
that the damage would not spread.
The fire at the coastal factory is believed to be from a chemical explosion.

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:05.360
Last night's residential area fire

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:06.910
was extinguished early this morning.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.910
No injuries were reported.

00:21:35.590 --> 00:21:37.270
It's big.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:41.130
Was my family always this rich?

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:47.210
My new life is going to start here, huh?

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:49.780
Hello!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.750
Are you going to be living in this house?

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:57.120
Y-Yes.

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.510
So you're our new neighbor, then!

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:01.920
Ah, I'm Yuuki Yuuna!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.000
Nice to meet you!

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.180
Tougou Mimori.

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:56.560
"That is a very commendable thing...”

00:23:56.560 --> 00:24:00.400
My parents said as they cried...

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:02.640
Wasshi...
